# Failures attaching directly to one Herdr terminal.

error-client-terminal-attach-busy = 等待中的终端滚动请求过多
error-client-terminal-attach-ended = 终端连接已结束
error-client-terminal-attach-io = 终端连接 I/O 失败
error-client-terminal-attach-protocol = 终端连接分帧失败
error-client-terminal-attach-refused = Herdr 拒绝了终端连接
# $reason is Herdr's own message, kept as it is.
error-client-terminal-attach-refused-reason = Herdr 拒绝了终端连接：{ $reason }
# $version is a protocol version number.
error-client-terminal-attach-rejected = Herdr 拒绝了终端握手（协议 { $version }）
error-client-terminal-attach-scroll = 终端滚动必须至少移动一行
error-client-terminal-attach-size = 终端尺寸不能为零
error-client-terminal-attach-unexpected = Herdr 对终端握手返回了意外消息
